Package: RomicsProcessor
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Omics Data Processing and Analysis Pipelines
Version: 2.0.0
Author: Geremy Clair <geremy.clair@pnnl.gov>
Maintainer: Geremy Clair <geremy.clair@pnnl.gov>
Description: An omics-oriented package enabling reproducible and shareable data processing pipelines.
    This package processes omics datasets using a romics_object data structure that encapsulates
    data, metadata, and processing history to ensure FAIR-compatible (Findable, Accessible,
    Interoperable, Reusable) science. The romics_object contains all details necessary to reprocess
    data identically and create reusable analytical pipelines. Supports bulk, single-cell, and
    spatial omics data including proteomics, metabolomics, and genomics applications.
